# Every discoverable area of Elwynn Forest, Dun Morogh, Loch Modan, Westfall,
# Redridge Mountains, Duskwood, Wetlands, Hillsbrad Foothills, Silverpine
# Forest, Tirisfal Glades (138 map overlays), for both factions. Each `explore`
# point is the centre of the area's map overlay hit rect in the Forever client's
# tables (WorldMapOverlay, UiMapXMapArt, UiMap, AreaTable via wago.tools, build
# 1.60.1.70338), in the map's live frame (written `live` where Forever moved the
# map or added it, else the Era frame it equals); area levels are
# AreaTable.ExplorationLevel; flight masters come from data/forever/travel.json.
# Zone order and travel lines are tools/lib/exploration/spec.js; inside a zone
# the areas are a shortest tour from where you arrive towards the next zone.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Alliance

step Elwynn Forest (1/2)
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
